  "title": "05 · Creating a batch and issuing item QRs",
  "description": "Manufacturer (`sunpharma`) → Batches → create a batch. Sign in as `sunqa` to approve it.\nBack as `sunpharma` → Issue → pick the batch and a number of items → every item's QR appears, each with its hidden code.",
