      },
      "title": "Creating a batch",
      "description": "### Creating a batch\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519), 11. Trie, 12. AVL tree\n\nThe batch is **signed** by the manufacturer. Its id goes into the **trie** (for search by prefix), and its expiry date into the **AVL tree** (for 'what expires soon')."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 305,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 317,
          "character": 4
        }
      },
      "title": "A second person must approve",
      "description": "### A second person must approve\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519)\n\nA quality approver of the same manufacturer **co-signs** the batch. One person alone cannot issue items, which stops an insider from printing extra codes."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/pages/portals/Manufacturer.tsx",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 253,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 258,
          "character": 159
        }
      },
      "title": "Each item is made and signed in the browser",
      "description": "### Each item is made and signed in the browser\n\n**DSA topic:** 1. SHA-256 hashing, 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519), 4. Hash chain (linked list by hashes)\n\nEach item gets a **random salt**, so no one can guess valid item details.\nA random **hidden code** is made for inside the pack. Only its **SHA-256 hash** is sent to the server.\n`signUnit` signs the item's fingerprint. The first custody record (`MANUFACTURED`) has `prev: \"0\"`: it is the **first link of the hash chain**."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 349,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 349,
          "character": 162
        }
      },
      "title": "Issuance limit",
      "description": "### Issuance limit\n\nThe server never issues more items than the batch quantity."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 354,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
