        }
      },
      "title": "Every item's signature is checked",
      "description": "### Every item's signature is checked\n\n**DSA topic:** 2. Digital signatures (Ed25519)\n\nThe server checks the signature on each item and on its first custody record before saving."
    },
    {
      "file": "server/app.ts",
      "selection": {
