        }
      },
      "title": "Item ids go into the trie and the last-seen map",
      "description": "### Item ids go into the trie and the last-seen map\n\n**DSA topic:** 11. Trie, 3. Hash map / hash set\n\nEach item id is added to the **trie** (search) and its first location to the `lastSeen` **hash map** (used for clone detection)."
    }
